<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>KARACHI, Jan 7 - five container vessels waiting, the first waiting for three days. Seven fertiliser vessels waiting, the first waiting for 12 days. Two oil tankers waiting, the first for five days, and one loader waiting for six days. Five other vessels laid up off port for own reasons.</p>
</text>
